(7215046, 1112203, 114225, '<td valign="top">Good clean image, seems to fit the theme well. Why did you de-saturate and remove the nice bright colors?</td>', 'Good clean image, seems to fit the theme well. Why did you de-saturate and remove the nice bright colors?', '2014-05-09 10:55:50.000000', NULL, 1),
