(7217140, 1111937, 38921, '<td valign="top">Some good and some not so here IMO.  The good... well exposed, focus is near eye as it should be, and I like the fall off from the depth of field.<br/> <br/>The not so good...  I am not a fan of having the camera above subject for portraiture.  Also the lighting is too harsh as you have hard shadows created by the nose and dress. Diffusing the light and using a reflector on camera right would have helped with the nose shadow.  Shooting from a lower angle would have eliminated the dress shadow.</td>', 'Some good and some not so here IMO.  The good... well exposed, focus is near eye as it should be, and I like the fall off from the depth of field. The not so good...  I am not a fan of having the camera above subject for portraiture.  Also the lighting is too harsh as you have hard shadows created by the nose and dress. Diffusing the light and using a reflector on camera right would have helped with the nose shadow.  Shooting from a lower angle would have eliminated the dress shadow.', '2014-05-15 15:21:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7217141, 1112159, 38921, '<td valign="top">A great scene.  You pushed the saturation a bit too far for my taste though.</td>', 'A great scene.  You pushed the saturation a bit too far for my taste though.', '2014-05-15 15:22:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7217142, 1112211, 38921, '<td valign="top">You needed a bigger depth of field here to keep the entire puppet in focus.  I also would have cropped out the hand.</td>', 'You needed a bigger depth of field here to keep the entire puppet in focus.  I also would have cropped out the hand.', '2014-05-15 15:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7217143, 1112182, 38921, '<td valign="top">I like the image but not seeing a real strong connection with topic other than the title.</td>', 'I like the image but not seeing a real strong connection with topic other than the title.', '2014-05-15 15:25:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7217192, 1112136, 38921, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and lighting.  Perhaps just a bit more light at the top to better define the bottle.</td>', 'Nice colors and lighting.  Perhaps just a bit more light at the top to better define the bottle.', '2014-05-15 18:07:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7217193, 1112190, 38921, '<td valign="top">Very nice... only complaint is the glassware needs a bit of cleaning.</td>', 'Very nice... only complaint is the glassware needs a bit of cleaning.', '2014-05-15 18:08:07.000000', NULL, 1),
