(7217197, 1112186, 38921, '<td valign="top">I would have preferred a higher camera angle but I am guessing they were on stage so that was probably not really possible.  The background is a bit distracting so a lower depth of field could have helped there.  I think the conversion to black and white was a good choice.  7</td>', 'I would have preferred a higher camera angle but I am guessing they were on stage so that was probably not really possible.  The background is a bit distracting so a lower depth of field could have helped there.  I think the conversion to black and white was a good choice.  7', '2014-05-15 18:11:25.000000', NULL, 1),
