(7217730, 1112190, 103142, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Ja-9:</b></div><hr/><i> So how did you get the star burst?   Well done Wendy!!! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I was having problems getting the backlighting right. When I pointed the flash down, it ended up lighting the foreground too much. So the flash is actually right behind the top of the bottle. I shot so that the bottle covered most of the flash and let the burst through.</td>', 'Originally posted by Ja-9: So how did you get the star burst?   Well done Wendy!!!   I was having problems getting the backlighting right. When I pointed the flash down, it ended up lighting the foreground too much. So the flash is actually right behind the top of the bottle. I shot so that the bottle covered most of the flash and let the burst through.', '2014-05-17 17:09:17.000000', NULL, 0),
